-/// foreground asks again. An app that went to the background while a prompt was showing (Android
-/// shows the device passcode in another activity) is not locked by that.
+/// foreground asks again. An app that went to the background while the lock screen's prompt was
+/// showing (Android shows the device passcode in another activity) is not locked by that, so that
+/// a cancel does not ask again at once; for the switch's prompt it counts after
+/// [kHjvAppLockSwitchGrace] more. While the lock is on, the app is shaded whenever it is not in
+/// the foreground.
